**Extracting content with Python**

I'm focusing on extracting content from sections 5-7 and 18, ensuring I grab everything necessary, like the list of controls and kit items. I’ll use a Python script to slice the text from each heading to the next one. The plan is to keep the output manageable, so I’ll print each section (5, 6, 7, and 18) separately. Running the script in exec will help with that process!
